<DocsLayout title="Mac Installation - Dasher">
  <h1>Mac Installation</h1>

  <p>Dasher is an information-efficient text-entry interface, driven by natural continuous pointing gestures. Dasher is a competitive text-entry system wherever a full-size keyboard cannot be used.</p>

  <h2>Installation</h2>
  <p>Mac installation is currently under development. Please check back soon for detailed installation instructions.</p>

  <h2>Other Platforms</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/install/windows/">Windows</a></li>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/install/linux/">Linux</a></li>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/install/android/">Android</a></li>
    <li><a href="/docs/getting-started/install/">View all platforms</a></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="note-box">
    <h3>Note</h3>
    <p>The Mac version of Dasher is being actively developed. For the latest updates, please check our <a href="https://github.com/dasher-project/dasher" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repository</a>.</p>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>

